(*"measure_schema.measure_with_unit"
A *measure\_with\_unit* is the specification of a physical quantity as defined in ISO 31. A *measure\_with\_unit* may be either a express_ref:[measure_schema.length_measure_with_unit] or a express_ref:[measure_schema.mass_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.time_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.electric_current_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.thermodynamic_temperature_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.celsius_temperature_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.amount_of_substance_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.luminous_intensity_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.plane_angle_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.solid_angle_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.area_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.volume_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.ratio_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.acceleration_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.capacitance_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.electric_charge_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.conductance_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.electric_potential_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.energy_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.magnetic_flux_density_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.force_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.frequency_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.illuminance_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.inductance_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.luminous_flux_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.magnetic_flux_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.power_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.pressure_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.resistance_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.velocity_measure_with_unit], or an express_ref:[measure_schema.absorbed_dose_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.radioactivity_measure_with_unit], or a express_ref:[measure_schema.dose_equivalent_measure_with_unit].
*)

